    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**** Open Viewing - Saturday 3rd October 4pm - 4:20pm *****\r\n           Call/Text Siobhan on 087 2737812 to arrange\r\n\r\nLynam Auctioneers are delighted to be instructed on this truly unique home which is presented in turnkey condition and ideally positioned along the prestigious Coast Road in Malahide, enjoying breathtaking panoramic views out to sea as\r\nfar as they eye can see including Lambay Island.\r\n\r\nThis stunning residence is the largest within the complex. It offers a bright, spacious open-plan kitchen, dining and living area boasting stunning sea views. Finished to an impeccable standard throughout, the property combines modern elegance with coastal tranquillity.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises an inviting entrance hall, expansive open-plan living space with a contemporary kitchen and island unit, three large bedrooms.\r\n\r\nThe property further benefits from an especially large balcony, offering wonderful coastal views. Located just minutes from Malahide Village and close proximity to Dublin Airport, residents can enjoy a wealth of amenities including renowned restaurants, cafés, boutiques, scenic coastal walks, and excellent transport links via DART and Dublin Airport. Low Rock, across the road is ideal for sea swimming.\r\nFlooded with natural light and presented in turnkey condition, Apartment 4 is perfectly suited to those seeking elegant, low-maintenance living in one of Dublin’s most desirable locations."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Accommodation\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall: Welcoming entrance hall with hardwood engineered floors, extra high ceilings with Coving, luxurious and on trend fixtures and fittings. Includes a large cloakroom/Storage area and Guest WC.\r\n\r\nLiving, Dining, Kitchen Quarters: The main living space flows perfectly, creating a bright airy room which has direct access to a large private balcony, perfectly positioned to take full advantage of the stunning coastal views.\r\nThe finish is of the highest quality including hardwood engineered floors, the finest of appliances including Neff Fridge/Freezer, Ovens, Quooker Tap, dishwasher, extractor fan, hob and more. Ample storage is provided through the Alwood by Alfred Briggs kitchen units as well as a generous kitchen island with integrated informal dining seating and extensive storage.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 + Ensuite: This bedroom is spacious and of the highest quality including fitted wardrobes, coving, shutters, motorised blinds and luxurious carpeted floor.\r\n\r\nBedrooms 2 & 3:  Both bedrooms 2 & 3 are large and the finish is of the highest quality including fitted wardrobes (in larger of the two bedrooms), shutters, motorised blinds, coving and luxurious carpeted floor.\r\n\r\nGuest WC: Complete with bath and separate shower, WC, WHB and vanity unit, light up mirror, heated towel rail, tiled floor and tiled walls.\r\n\r\nUtility Room: A wonderful addition to the home, this room ensures peace and quiet in the living quarters when appliances are in use and benefits from custom made storage, tiled flooring and is plumbed for both a washing machine, dryer and utility sink.\r\n\r\nStorage Room: including shelving.\r\n\r\nOutdoor Space\r\n* X-Large Balcony\r\n* Coastal and Urban views\r\n* Seamless indoor-outdoor flow\r\n* Secure, well-maintained development\r\n* Controlled access (fob/intercom entry)\r\n* Designated parking\r\n* Low-density, peaceful coastal setting\r\n* Garden areas\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the quality, light, and exceptional setting of this superb coastal residence.\r\n\r\nWhilst every care has been taken in the preparation of these particulars, and they are believed to be correct, they are not warranted and intending purchasers / lessees should satisfy themselves as to the correctness of information given.\r\n\r\nFeatures\r\nSolar panels\r\nSpectacular Sea Views with X-Large Balcony\r\nWalk to all amenities\r\n5 Star Finish\r\nParking\r\nBER A2 – Green Mortgage\r\nIdeal Right - Sizing Home\r\nAlwood by Alfred Briggs kitchens with Quooker Tap\r\nHardwood engineered floors\r\nBespoke joinery and doors.\r\n3 large bedrooms \r\nExtra-High Ceilings\r\nLuxury Common Areas\r\nLift Access\r\nHotel Standard common areas\r\nAppealing brick finish externally."
      },
